WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,980 --> 00:00:03,620
I won't become a part of their play, right?

2
00:00:03,620 --> 00:00:05,220
They all bullied me.

3
00:00:05,220 --> 00:00:07,340
If I were a pretender

4
00:00:07,340 --> 00:00:09,020
It seems like I'm easy to bully

5
00:00:09,020 --> 00:00:10,320
He Qingying

6
00:00:10,320 --> 00:00:11,760
Since you dare to do it

7
00:00:11,760 --> 00:00:14,200
I'll let you show your fox tail yourself

8
00:00:14,200 --> 00:00:18,680
do you know

9
00:00:18,680 --> 00:00:20,880
Lu Yun has been crazy about catching Ness lately.

10
00:00:20,880 --> 00:00:22,840
The Lu family occupied the prince's team

11
00:00:22,840 --> 00:00:25,440
I've gotten a lot of good jobs in the imperial court these days.

12
00:00:25,440 --> 00:00:27,240
Wherever I go there are people holding me

13
00:00:27,240 --> 00:00:29,080
Xiao Chengzhi has always been like this

14
00:00:29,080 --> 00:00:32,160
Benefits are given when employing people

15
00:00:32,440 --> 00:00:34,130
Lu Yunheng

16
00:00:34,130 --> 00:00:35,870
the higher you climb

17
00:00:35,870 --> 00:00:41,210
The fall will be worse in the future

18
00:00:41,210 --> 00:00:44,290
In the past, he couldn't compare to you now.

19
00:00:44,290 --> 00:00:45,610
I heard people say

20
00:00:45,610 --> 00:00:47,130
Announce the vacancy

21
00:00:47,130 --> 00:00:48,690
Your family has made up for it

22
00:00:48,690 --> 00:00:49,730
That's fine too

23
00:00:49,730 --> 00:00:51,490
It's better than having the wall taken away by outsiders
